    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text says only where the section does not apply

§§ `ss 1077 to 1079 Public notice of receipt of certain documents`

DECLARE `s 1078 kind of document` IS ONE OF
    `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 1: the company's memorandum and articles`
    `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 2: any amendment of the company's articles (including every resolution or agreement required to be embodied ...`
    `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 3: after any amendment of the company's articles, the text of the articles as amended`
    `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 4: any notice of a change of the company's name`
    `s 1078(2) directors 1: the statement of proposed officers required on formation of the company`
    `s 1078(2) directors 2: notification of any change among the company's directors`
    `s 1078(2) directors 3: notification of any change in the particulars of directors required to be delivered to the registrar`
    `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 1: all documents required to be delivered to the registrar under section 441 (annual accounts and reports)`
    `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 1A: all documents delivered to the registrar under sections 394A(2)(e), 448A(2)(e) and 479A(2)(e) (qualifying ...`
    `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 2: any confirmation statement delivered by the company under section 853A`
    `s 1078(2) registered office 1: notification of any change of the company's registered office`
    `s 1078(2) winding up 1: copy of any winding-up order in respect of the company`
    `s 1078(2) winding up 2: notice of the appointment of liquidators`
    `s 1078(2) winding up 3: order for the dissolution of a company on a winding up`
