    `s 1078(3) share capital 4: copy of any report under section 593 or 599 as to the value of a non-cash asset`
    `s 1078(3) share capital 5: statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 625 (notice by company of redenomination of ...`
    `s 1078(3) share capital 6: statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 627 (notice by company of reduction of ...`
    `s 1078(3) share capital 7: notice delivered under section 636 (notice of new name of class of shares) or 637 (notice of variation of ...`
    `s 1078(3) share capital 8: statement of capital accompanying order delivered under section 649 (order of court confirming reduction ...`
