-- The list defines the term ("The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows"), so a document none of whose heads holds answers JUST FALSE (ruling of 2026-11-05, delegated definitions (a)).
-- The company facts that decide each head are inputs; "public company" is section 4(2), supplied by the keel's answer.
-- src:15149 | 1078 Enhanced disclosure documents
-- src:15150 | (1) The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows.
-- src:15152 | (2) In the case of every company—
-- src:15153 | Constitutional documents
-- src:15154 | 1. The company's memorandum and articles.
-- src:15155 | 2. Any amendment of the company's articles (including every resolution or agreement required to be embodied in or annexed to copies of the company's articles issued by the company).
-- src:15156 | 3. After any amendment of the company's articles, the text of the articles as amended.
-- src:15157 | 4. Any notice of a change of the company's name.
-- src:15158 | Directors
-- src:15159 | 1. The statement of proposed officers required on formation of the company.
-- src:15160 | 2. Notification of any change among the company's directors.
-- src:15161 | 3. Notification of any change in the particulars of directors required to be delivered to the registrar.
-- src:15162 | Accounts and reports etc
-- src:15163 | 1. All documents required to be delivered to the registrar under section 441 (annual accounts and reports).
-- src:15164 | 1A. All documents delivered to the registrar under sections 394A(2)(e), 448A(2)(e) and 479A(2)(e) (qualifying subsidiary companies: conditions for exemption from the audit, preparation and filing of individual accounts).
-- src:15165 | 2. Any confirmation statement delivered by the company under section 853A.
-- src:15166 | Registered office
-- src:15167 | Notification of any change of the company's registered office.
-- src:15168 | Winding up
-- src:15169 | 1. Copy of any winding-up order in respect of the company.
-- src:15170 | 2. Notice of the appointment of liquidators.
-- src:15171 | 3. Order for the dissolution of a company on a winding up.
-- src:15172 | 4. Return by a liquidator of the final meeting of a company on a winding up.
-- src:15173 | (3) In the case of a public company—
-- src:15174 | Share capital
-- src:15175 | 1. Any statement of capital and initial shareholdings.
-- src:15176 | 2. Any return of allotment and the statement of capital accompanying it.
-- src:15177 | 3. Copy of any resolution under section 570 or 571 (disapplication of pre-emption rights).
-- src:15178 | 4. Copy of any report under section 593 or 599 as to the value of a non-cash asset.
-- src:15179 | 5. Statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 625 (notice by company of redenomination of shares).
-- src:15180 | 6. Statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 627 (notice by company of reduction of capital in connection with redenomination of shares).
-- src:15181 | 7. Notice delivered under section 636 (notice of new name of class of shares) or 637 (notice of variation of rights attached to shares).
-- src:15182 | 8. Statement of capital accompanying order delivered under section 649 (order of court confirming reduction of capital).
-- src:15183 | 9. Notification (under section 689) of the redemption of shares and the statement of capital accompanying it.
-- src:15184 | 10. Statement of capital accompanying return delivered under section 708 (notice of cancellation of shares on purchase of own shares) or 730 (notice of cancellation of shares held as treasury shares).
-- src:15185 | 11. Any statement of compliance delivered under section 762 (statement that company meets conditions for issue of trading certificate).
-- src:15186 | 12. Any statement delivered under section 762(1)(e) (statement of the aggregate amount paid up on shares on account of their nominal value).
-- src:15187 | Mergers and divisions
-- src:15188 | 1. Copy of any draft of the terms of a scheme required to be delivered to the registrar under section 906 or 921.
-- src:15189 | 2. Copy of any order under section 899, 900, 901F or 901J in respect of a compromise or arrangement to which Part 27 (mergers and divisions of public companies) applies.
-- src:15190 | (3A) In the case of a private company which applies to re-register as a public company, the statement delivered under section 94(2)(e) (statement of the aggregate amount paid up on shares on account of their nominal value).
-- src:15191 | (4) Where a private company re-registers as a public company (see section 96)—
-- src:15192 | (a) the last statement of capital relating to the company received by the registrar under any provision of the Companies Acts becomes an enhanced disclosure document, and
-- src:15193 | (b) section 1077 (public notice of receipt of certain documents) applies as if the statement had been received by the registrar when the re-registration takes effect.
-- src:15194 | (4A) Where a company is required by regulation 14 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver to the registrar a report or consolidated report on payments to governments, that report or consolidated report.
-- src:15195 | (4B) Where a company is required by regulation 15 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver to the registrar information on payments to governments which is contained in a report or consolidated report prepared in accordance with equivalent reporting requirements (within the meaning of those Regulations), that information.
-- src:15196 | (5) In the case of an overseas company, such particulars, returns and other documents required to be delivered under Part 34 as may be specified by the Secretary of State by regulations.
-- src:15197 | (6) Regulations under subsection (5) are subject to negative resolution procedure.
@ref s 1078 Enhanced disclosure documents (src:15149-15197)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 1078 kind of document`
      `s 4(2) the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is a private company that has applied to re-register as a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a private company has re-registered as a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is required by regulation 14 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver a report or consolidated report` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is required by regulation 15 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver information` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is an overseas company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1078 the document is an enhanced disclosure document` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 1: the company's memorandum and articles` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 2: any amendment of the company's articles (including every resolution or agreement required to be embodied ...` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 3: after any amendment of the company's articles, the text of the articles as amended` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 4: any notice of a change of the company's name` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) directors 1: the statement of proposed officers required on formation of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) directors 2: notification of any change among the company's directors` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) directors 3: notification of any change in the particulars of directors required to be delivered to the registrar` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 1: all documents required to be delivered to the registrar under section 441 (annual accounts and reports)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 1A: all documents delivered to the registrar under sections 394A(2)(e), 448A(2)(e) and 479A(2)(e) (qualifying ...` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) accounts and reports etc 2: any confirmation statement delivered by the company under section 853A` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) registered office 1: notification of any change of the company's registered office` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) winding up 1: copy of any winding-up order in respect of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) winding up 2: notice of the appointment of liquidators` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) winding up 3: order for the dissolution of a company on a winding up` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(2) winding up 4: return by a liquidator of the final meeting of a company on a winding up` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 1: any statement of capital and initial shareholdings` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 2: any return of allotment and the statement of capital accompanying it` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 3: copy of any resolution under section 570 or 571 (disapplication of pre-emption rights)` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 4: copy of any report under section 593 or 599 as to the value of a non-cash asset` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 5: statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 625 (notice by company of redenomination of ...` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 6: statement of capital accompanying notice given under section 627 (notice by company of reduction of ...` THEN
