        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) share capital 12: any statement delivered under section 762(1)(e) (statement of the aggregate amount paid up on shares on ...` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) mergers and divisions 1: copy of any draft of the terms of a scheme required to be delivered to the registrar under section 906 or 921` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3) mergers and divisions 2: copy of any order under section 899, 900, 901F or 901J in respect of a compromise or arrangement to which ...` THEN
        IF `s 4(2) the company is a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(3A): in the case of a private company which applies to re-register as a public company, the statement delivered ...` THEN
        IF `the company is a private company that has applied to re-register as a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(4)(a): where a private company re-registers as a public company, the last statement of capital relating to the ...` THEN
        IF `a private company has re-registered as a public company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(4A): where a company is required by regulation 14 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to ...` THEN
        IF `the company is required by regulation 14 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver a report or consolidated report`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(4B): where a company is required by regulation 15 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to ...` THEN
        IF `the company is required by regulation 15 of the Reports on Payments to Governments Regulations 2014 to deliver information`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078(5): in the case of an overseas company, such particulars, returns and other documents required to be delivered ...` THEN
        IF `the company is an overseas company`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and no head of the list holds for this company (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
    WHEN `s 1078 another document` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The enhanced disclosure documents are as follows" and the document is in none of the heads (delegated definition, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))

-- Which head a person means, named as the text prints it: the subsection (2, 3, 3A, 4, 4A, 4B or 5), the heading of the list in
-- subsections (2) and (3) (for example "Directors") and the item number (for example "2"). Subsection (4) is paragraph (a) only.
@ref s 1078 Enhanced disclosure documents: the head named by its printed number (src:15149-15197)
GIVEN `the subsection of section 1078` IS A STRING
      `the heading of the list, or the empty string` IS A STRING
      `the item number, or the empty string` IS A STRING
GIVETH A `s 1078 kind of document`
`s 1078 the head of the list named by its printed number` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the subsection of section 1078` EQUALS "2" AND `the heading of the list, or the empty string` EQUALS "Constitutional documents" AND `the item number, or the empty string` EQUALS "1" THEN `s 1078(2) constitutional documents 1: the company's memorandum and articles`
